# The third-party attribution gate (scripts/check-third-party-licenses.mjs)
# hashes these files' working-tree bytes. Pin them to LF so a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true hashes the same bytes CI does - otherwise a regen
# done on Windows stamps CRLF-based hashes that CI's LF checkout rejects.
pnpm-lock.yaml text eol=lf
src-tauri/Cargo.lock text eol=lf
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md text eol=lf
